            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra el estado de la configuración de actualización automática mostrando <code>False</code> en la consola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Auto update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Auto update\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
